~ start
Az: Are we safe?
Fenn: Yeah. Think so.
Winston: Oh Post. I can't believe... I... ugh
Fenn: What's wrong?
Winston: I'm the worst! That's what's wrong. I'm a failure, Fenn. I've failed.
Fenn: What? What are you talking about?
Winston: I can't do anything right, Fenn. I tried ambushing you. I threw minions in your way. I even tried to clone myself, something I know very well, and nothing worked. It's broken. It's all broken.
Winston: I don't have anything left. You won. Congrats.
Fenn: Why are you being so mean?
Winston: What?
Fenn: You're being really mean to yourself. I had fun today. I think that's more important
Winston: Y-you... what?
Fenn: I had fun! It was fun, wasn't it, Az?
Az: I mean... your creations were pretty cool.
Winston: Wait... what?
Az: Yeah. Besides the picture frame, my workshop looked even cleaner. You managed to make all that stuff with the scraps I had lying around?
Winston: I... I can fix it! I promise. I didn't- I mean- I- I wasn't thinking
Az: Hey man, it's all good. You kinda saved me with that inhaler.
Winston: Yea- yeah. I saw a few in the workshop. I didn't- I mean- I didn't want you to... to die.
Winston: Th-thanks for saving me.
Az: You should be thanking Fenn. He convinced me to get over myself.
Fenn: If you died... who else would make cool icy things?
Winston: Haha... I... I don't know, I guess.
Winston: Are we... are we good?
Az: Yeah. Help free my Baba, and we're good.
Winston: Oh, right. Yeah.
Fade to black, fade back in with characters in front of the door seal
Winston raises his hand, magical particles appear, and then the glowing ice symbol stops glowing on the door.
Winston: There. All done. Won't be much help without the others, though...
Fenn: Where could I find them?
Winston: I think I saw Randy head towards the kitchen... but... that's all I got. Sorry.
Fenn: Well... to the kitchen!
